  "highlight": "Marilyn Korzekwa crossed the English Channel from England to France in 16 hours 40 minutes on 21 August 2011.",
  "biography": [
    "Korzekwa was 54 when she crossed the English Channel. Solo Swims of Ontario credits her as the first Canadian to complete the English Channel, Catalina and Manhattan Triple Crown. The organisation also records her separate California Triple Crown, which includes Lake Tahoe and the Santa Barbara Channel.",
    "The English Channel swim on 21 August 2011 took 16 hours 40 minutes. The Catalina federation records 14 hours 24 minutes 24 seconds on 30 August 2013. In New York the 12 July 2014 Manhattan circuit took 10 hours 2 minutes 21 seconds."
